  "description": "The Loki Bulk Data Processor is a high-performance .NET library for fast, scalable bulk data ingestion using SQL Server's Bulk Copy engine. Built for ASP.NET Core, it supports saving from model collections, DataTables, IDataReaders, and JSON streams — making it ideal for ETL workflows and real-time processing. Includes built-in mapping support, structured logging (v5.5+), and flexible dependency injection configuration.\n      For tutorials and demos, visit the Loki Software YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZSEs5w0PEySBdb9uFE19FQ/playlists",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
